    "text": {
     "en": "In a monarchy a king or queen rules, often by inheritance. In a democracy the people choose their rulers by voting.\nIndia is a democracy: all citizens aged 18 and over can vote. Leaders are elected for a fixed time and can be changed by the people.\nDemocracy values equality, rights and the rule of law."
    }
